- Applies to all ARN holders and their directors, partners, sub-distributors, employees, representatives
- Fiduciary duty:
  - Investor''s interest paramount; due diligence; independent judgment
  - Avoid/disclose conflicts – including group/associate products
  - Incentives must not drive recommendations; no aggressive sales culture
  - No rebating of commission, gifts or vouchers
  - No churning, split applications, payment defaults, false payout claims, mis-selling
- **Compliance:** follow SEBI MF Regulations & AMFI circulars; segregate advisory & distribution; KYD; diligent IPV & document attestation
- Know SID/SAI/KIM; explain features & risks; gather client financial status, experience, objectives for suitability
- Qualified representatives; confidentiality – no sharing without consent, no cross-marketing to group companies; follow data protection rules
- Only engage sub-distributors with valid ARN

## Appendix 3: AMFI Code for Distributors (2/2)

- **Infrastructure:** physical & digital (cyber security); internal controls to prevent mis-selling & fraud; insurance encouraged; keep client records incl. suitability consent/dissent
- Client obligations:
  - Provide full scheme information; highlight risks; urge reading SID/SAI/KIM
  - Disclose commissions on competing schemes & list of affiliated MFs; disclose association with AMC
  - MFDs cannot deal in Direct Plans; platforms must state ''Regular Plan'' + commission & document links
  - No indicative portfolio, yield or assured returns
  - Fill forms with investor''s own details only; no tampering; quote EUIN
  - Help resolve grievances; use only AMC-approved material; fair comparisons; explain risks incl. suspension, segregation, winding up
- **Other:** NISM certification, ARN & EUIN renewed on time; staff training incl. responsible social media; cooperate with AMCs/AMFI/SEBI; report changes & misconduct; refund clawed-back commissions
- Cannot use "Adviser", "Wealth Manager", "Consultant" etc. unless SEBI-registered RIA
- Tagline "AMFI-registered Mutual Fund Distributor" (min font 12 in print) on all communication
- **Industry integrity:** no unfair practices; no false or defamatory statements or rumours about AMCs, AMFI, schemes or other MFDs

